Singapore — Grab paid $600 million for Delivery Hero's Taiwan operations. Southeast Asian super-app Grab, headquartered in Singapore, is expanding into Taiwan as Delivery Hero sells assets to reduce its debt. Grab absorbs Foodpanda Taiwan, competing directly with domestic carriers in a market where Delivery Hero had struggled to turn a profit.
